Note on third-party material
----------------------------

The MIT terms above cover the data files in this repository. They do not and
cannot cover material owned by others:

* The experimental Debye-Waller values in data/literature/ are derived from
  published papers, cited per row. The papers themselves are not redistributed
  here. Reuse of those numbers should cite the original sources listed there,
  not only this repository.
* data/dft_raw/ holds outputs of AFLOW and VASP runs performed by the authors.
  The outputs are the authors' own; the programs that produced them are not
  included and carry their own licences.
